    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A thrilling journey through the vast\u2026 living room. Breathtaking views\u2026 of the kitchen interior. Intense battles\u2026 against dust and dirt.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If only it were that simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth and save her \u2014 because you are the smartest device in this house. A Vacuum Cleaner. Her only hope for escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life was simple. Your only concern was cleaning \u2014 until something went wrong. Something bad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you must explore the house to uncover the truth. You are a robovac with an extraordinary ability to hack into smart devices. Find clues, scan surfaces, investigate, and, of course\u2026 clean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may be just a vacuum, but you\u2019re her only hope.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean</strong> is a single-player, third-person adventure game with detective elements. As a robovac, you must gather and piece together clues to unravel a mysterious case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use advanced tools like a UV scanner, flashlight, and your unique ability to connect to laptops, media players, cameras, smartwatches, and other devices. Every tool is essential as you navigate the environment, solve puzzles, and reveal the hidden truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509340/extras/8d3e1736d5f40aef0bce950c2e965b03.poster.avif?t=1745423702\" width=500 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509340/extras/8d3e1736d5f40aef0bce950c2e965b03.webm?t=1745423702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509340/extras/8d3e1736d5f40aef0bce950c2e965b03.mp4?t=1745423702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Audience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean</strong> explores thought-provoking social themes and is designed for a mature audience, though it remains accessible to all players.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A thrilling journey through the vast\u2026 living room. Breathtaking views\u2026 of the kitchen interior. Intense battles\u2026 against dust and dirt.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If only it were that simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth and save her \u2014 because you are the smartest device in this house. A Vacuum Cleaner. Her only hope for escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life was simple. Your only concern was cleaning \u2014 until something went wrong. Something bad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you must explore the house to uncover the truth. You are a robovac with an extraordinary ability to hack into smart devices. Find clues, scan surfaces, investigate, and, of course\u2026 clean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may be just a vacuum, but you\u2019re her only hope.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean</strong> is a single-player, third-person adventure game with detective elements. As a robovac, you must gather and piece together clues to unravel a mysterious case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use advanced tools like a UV scanner, flashlight, and your unique ability to connect to laptops, media players, cameras, smartwatches, and other devices. Every tool is essential as you navigate the environment, solve puzzles, and reveal the hidden truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509340/extras/8d3e1736d5f40aef0bce950c2e965b03.poster.avif?t=1745423702\" width=500 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509340/extras/8d3e1736d5f40aef0bce950c2e965b03.webm?t=1745423702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509340/extras/8d3e1736d5f40aef0bce950c2e965b03.mp4?t=1745423702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Audience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean</strong> explores thought-provoking social themes and is designed for a mature audience, though it remains accessible to all players.</p>",
